{% from "_macros.html.j2" import nation_table with context %}
<p class="close-kicker">Question 7</p>
<h1 class="slide-q">Goalkeepers</h1>
<p class="slide-a">{{ q7.home.nhl }} Czech goalkeepers reached the threshold in the NHL in {{ q7.season }} and {{ q7.home.top5 }} in the NHL plus rung 2: <strong>{{ f2(q7.home.top5_per_million) }} per million</strong>, {{ ordinal(q7.home.rank_top5) }} of {{ q7.n_nations }}, against a peer median of {{ f2(q7.peer_median.top5_per_million) }}.</p>
<figure class="figure-bleed" data-chart="q7-bars">
  {{ nation_table(q7.table, 'nhl', 'nhl_per_million', 'NHL goalkeepers') }}
  <figcaption>How to read it: as in question 1, for goalkeepers with at least the pro-rated games threshold in {{ q7.season }}. Czechia is {{ ordinal(q7.rank_nhl) }} in the NHL at {{ f2(q7.home.nhl_per_million) }} per million (peer median {{ f2(q7.peer_median.nhl_per_million) }}).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure class="figure-bleed" data-chart="q7-series">
  <table class="fig-table">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Season</th><th scope="col" class="num">Czech NHL goalkeepers</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>{% for s, n in q7.home_series %}<tr><td>{{ s }}</td><td class="num">{{ n if n is not none else 'lockout' }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
  </table>
  <figcaption>How to read it: qualifying NHL goalkeepers per nation, season by season. The Czech count is {{ q7.series_latest }} in {{ q7.season }}{% if q7.series_is_max %}, as many as in any season since 1995/96{% else %}; the most was {{ q7.series_max }}{% endif %}.</figcaption>
</figure>
<details class="fold slide-method" open>
  <summary>How we know</summary>
  <p class="slide-did"><span class="slide-did-label">Abroad</span> Czech goalkeepers' save percentage against the league-season median, {{ q7.window_abroad }}: NHL {{ '%+.1f'|format(q7.abroad.NHL.median_save_pct_minus_median * 100) }} points ({{ q7.abroad.NHL.goalies }} goalkeepers), Liiga {{ '%+.1f'|format(q7.abroad.Liiga.median_save_pct_minus_median * 100) }} ({{ q7.abroad.Liiga.goalies }}), SHL {{ '%+.1f'|format(q7.abroad.SHL.median_save_pct_minus_median * 100) }} ({{ q7.abroad.SHL.goalies }}). Small numbers: read them as descriptive.</p>
  <p class="slide-did"><span class="slide-did-label">Young goalkeepers at home</span> Goalkeepers aged 23 or less play {{ pct(q7.youth.Extraliga) }} of Extraliga goalkeeper games, against {{ pct(q7.youth.Liiga) }} in the Liiga and {{ pct(q7.youth.SHL) }} in the SHL ({{ q4.window }}). Czech goalkeepers played {{ pct0(q7.extraliga_home_share) }} of Extraliga goalkeeper games in {{ q7.season }}.</p>
  <p class="slide-how"><span class="slide-how-label">National team</span> Of {{ q7.nt.roster_spots }} goalkeeper roster spots since 2010, {{ q7.nt.by_category['1'] }} went to NHL goalkeepers, {{ q7.nt.by_category.khl }} to KHL goalkeepers, {{ q7.nt.by_category.home }} to Extraliga goalkeepers and {{ q7.nt.by_category['2'] }} to rung 2.</p>
</details>
